  "candidate": "Hi! The Canon R5 kit isn't available for 20\u201321 October, but for a full-frame 4K walkthrough with autofocus, I can offer our Sony setup:\n\n\u2022 Sony FX3 body: \u00a398 for the 2 days (\u00a349/day)\n\u2022 Sony GM 16-35mm f/2.8 lens: \u00a340 for the 2 days (\u00a320/day)\n\nCombined, the total is \u00a3138 for the two days, which fits right inside your \u00a3150 budget. The 16-35mm GM gives you full-frame autofocus and a great wide field of view for indoor walkthroughs.\n\nAlternatively, we also have the Sony A7 V body (\u00a384 for 2 days) paired with the same 16-35mm f/2.8 lens for \u00a3124 total.\n\nLet me know if either of those options suits your shoot!",
